    "\n",
    "# 🍎🍌🍊 Fruit Image Classifier (CNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "A small, fast, end-to-end example that trains a Convolutional Neural Network\n",
    "to classify images of **apples**, **bananas**, and **oranges**.\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "42a46eed",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-25T01:43:00.050875Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-07-25T01:43:00.050702Z",
